SUMMARY:Carve and Print Workshop
DESCRIPTION:We will be carving and printing our own 4x6” design into rubber. This is great for beginners and advanced printmakers. The cost covers all the supplies needed to make and print- the carving tools\, ink\, blocks\, paper\, and everything extra. You get to take your block and prints home with you. Carving tools are not to keep. Ages 15+
