DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
SUMMARY:Reel Reflections
DESCRIPTION:Step into the brand-new Heritage Center Theater for Reels of Reflection! Enjoy a screening of South & Saints\, a moving & humorous stage production\, complete with a bag of popcorn and an opportunity to stay afterward for engaging conversation and community connection.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/reel-reflections/26374/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventsoundbathhealingwithsabrinaremsberg26312-20261120@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Sound Bath Healing with Sabrina Remsberg
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in deep rest and renewal through the power of sound. In this workshop\, you’ll be guided into relaxation as the tones of crystal singing bowls\, chimes\, and other resonant instruments create a soothing\, immersive soundscape. Sound baths are more than just beautiful to listen to - they recalibrate body and mind through subtle energy. Vibrational tones: - Calm the nervous system and reduce stress - Support better sleep and deep relaxation - Release tension held in the body - Quiet busy thoughts and ease anxiety - Promote a meditative\, spacious state of awareness - Restore a sense of harmony and balance No prior experience is needed. Simply come as you are\, lie back comfortably\, and allow the waves of sound to wash through you. Many participants leave feeling lighter\, more grounded\, and deeply refreshed\, as if they’ve had hours of rest in just one session. Consider bringing your own pillow\, blanket\, extra mat/padding or anything else to make your experience cozy. We will provide a yoga mat\, bolster and extra blankets\, to assist to set you up comfortably.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/sound-bath-healing-with-sabrina-remsberg/26312/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthe90sunplugged26350-20261120@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:The 90's Unplugged
DESCRIPTION:Local musicians Will Sims\, Bekah Rogers\, and Gabe Singer are bringing The 90’s Unplugged: an open mic & live karaoke event to Sandbox Brewhouse! This is a Here for the Beats production\; an organization dedicated to bringing people together over live music for a good cause. Founded by Gabe and Bekah. Whether you’re participating on the stage or just there for the vibes\, you’re bound to have a blast. From talented musicians throwing their hat into the open mic\, to karaoke accompanied by real instrumentals\, there will surely be a little bit of everything musical at this event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-90s-unplugged/26350/
END:VEVENT
