BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthewharfratslivegratefuldeadband26342-20261120@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:The Wharf Rats LIVE Grateful Dead Band
DESCRIPTION:Don't miss one of the DMV's longest running GRATEFUL DEAD TRIBUTE BANDS! Get ready to jam! Rock\, Blues\, Soul\, Country\, Reggae\, You'll hear it all! Check out The Wharf Rats Live! @ Rockwell Brewery 11/20/26 @ 8PM One of the DMV's Best GRATEFUL DEAD TRIBUTE BAND is coming back to the Rockwell Stage - and YOU Are Invited!! Get ready to Jam! You are in store for a full band musical trip. this is a band and night you don't want to miss out on - They will definitely put a smile on your face and get you dancing all night long! These guys started fifteen years ago as a project to bring a new interpretation to the long format jam sound created by the Dead. The band has evolved over these past years to incorporate all of the classics\, as well as originals in the same genre. The sound is unique and captivating\, drawing the audience in as we expand our musical bounds that have no limits. \\
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-wharf-rats-live-grateful-dead-band/26342/
END:VEVENT
