DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:A Motown Christmas
DESCRIPTION:The Music & Magic of Motown Celebrate the season with A Motown Christmas \, a high-energy holiday spectacular featuring legendary vocalists from The Miracles and The Contours. Backed by a dynamic six-piece band\, these icons deliver powerful performances of timeless Motown hits and holiday classics\, all wrapped in lush harmonies and captivating choreography. Perfect for the whole family\, this festive concert invites audiences to sing\, dance\, and relive the golden age of soul music while embracing the warmth and joy of the holidays. Whether you’re a long-time Motown fan or discovering the magic of Motown music for the first time\, A Motown Christmas guarantees a night of celebration\, nostalgia\, and heart. Learn more about A Motown Christmas on the official website.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/a-motown-christmas/20746/
END:VEVENT
