DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Sing\, Potluck Supper\, & Dance at Fox Haven Farm!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for another Sing\, Supper & Dance at Fox Haven Farm! Bring your friends and family for a fun evening together! Start with our group Sing\, where everyone sings! Then mingle and connect with new friends over Supper\, potluck style. Finally\, join in dancing Squares\, Circles & Contras\, plus the Virginia Reel--featuring popular family dance caller Lucia Schaefer and marvelous musicians Gina Faber on guitar and Kirk Evans on fiddle. Welcoming all ages. No need for a partner or prior experience. Gender-neutral calling. Lots of fun! Tickets at https://tinyurl.com/yc33m2jb or use QR code on the flyer.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/sing-potluck-supper-%26-dance-at-fox-haven-farm!/26397/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventsip26script3aornamentlettering26351-20261121@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261120T182937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Sip & Script: Ornament Lettering
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Sip & Script: a modern calligraphy and ornament lettering class for beginners! Hosted by instructor Kim\, the first half of this class will cover all of the calligraphy basics that will empower you continue to utilize the art of calligraphy in your future projects. The second half will allow you to put your new skill set to use by lettering a 3” flat ornament for trimming your tree or gifting to someone special. While Kim is an instructor with Sip & Script\, she is also the owner of small business Kim INKspired Design. Your $80 ticket includes an hour and a half long instruction session\, a beginner’s calligraphy kit to keep\, a 3” flat ornament to take home\, and a drink ticket good for any beer\, NA\, or soda redemption.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/sip-%26-script%3a-ornament-lettering/26351/
END:VEVENT
