SUMMARY:Valley Craft Network Studio Tour
DESCRIPTION:As always\, the weekend before Thanksgiving each year we invite you on a driving tour to visit our studios and see our creative process up-close. We are always pleased to share our studios with you and hope you come away with information\, inspiration and one-of-a-kind gifts and treasures\, handmade in Maryland. FREE and Open To The Public. Throughout the year we continue to be working artists. Check out our work online\, make appointments to visit our studios\, or come out our galleries.
